      "content": "thanks for the breakdown on the stone. i think we'll lean towards granite since it's harder, but i'm worried about the cost of high-end sealing over the years. one last thing, though—with all the cleaning equipment and heavy carts moving in and out of a lobby like this, what's the biggest risk for sudden, unexpected damage like deep gouges or weird marks appearing overnight?",
